# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify-style redirects for canonical URLs
# 301 redirects so search engines drop the old (broken) URL from the index
# and credit link equity to the canonical path.
#
# Why? An earlier sitemap referenced /about-us & /contact-us, but the
# React routes were /about & /contact, so the old URLs returned the
# 200 SPA shell with a duplicate title — Google flagged this as
# "duplicate title" + "broken internal link" in the SEO audit (Feb 2026).

/about-us           /about              301
/contact-us         /contact            301
/terms-conditions   /terms              301
/refund             /refund-policy      301
/calculator         /referral-calculator       301
/earnings-calculator /referral-calculator      301
/prc-to-inr         /prc-to-inr-converter      301
/cashback-calculator /recharge-cashback-calculator 301
/earn-money-online  /how-to-earn-money-online-india 301
/delete.html        /delete-account     301

# SPA fallback — must be last
/*                  /index.html         200
